polynomials*, so its iterated derivatives at the origin exist and are given by the rational
function itself; the derivative limits required by `finiteBranch6_of_deriv_limits` are therefore
discharged **from the actual pull-backs**, not assumed as a `FiniteBranch6` premise. -/

